{"title":"Factorial","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>factorial</b> is an important function in <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Combinatorics\" title=\"Combinatorics\">combinatorics</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Analysis\" title=\"Analysis\">analysis</a>, used to determine the number of ways to arrange objects.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Factorials_Video\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Factorials Video</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Definition\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Definition</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Examples\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Examples</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Additional_Information\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Additional Information</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Prime_Factorization\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Prime Factorization</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Uses\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Uses</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Problems\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problems</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Introductory\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Introductory</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Intermediate\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Intermediate</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Olympiad\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Olympiad</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Factorials_Video\">Factorials Video</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Factorial&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Factorials Video\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://youtu.be/axFmwEI9ddk\">Factorials</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Definition\">Definition</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Factorial&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Definition\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The factorial is defined for <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Positive_integer\" title=\"Positive integer\">positive integers</a> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/b/63b418764e350453b8a21062cc8e01cb829a6718.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n!=n \\cdot (n-1) \\cdots 2 \\cdot 1 = \\prod_{i=1}^n i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"234\" height=\"48\" />.  Alternatively, a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Recursion\" title=\"Recursion\">recursive definition</a> for the factorial is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/3/323483c535cc431bcb97a48a07d9d66b36c5d957.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n!=n \\cdot (n-1)!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"124\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Examples\">Examples</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Factorial&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Examples\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019528532ecd654053bdee316fce3f77351d4989.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0! = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" /></li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/6/7a69a487f9de2ae14f96a16d97179773179e72f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1! = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" /></li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/e/08eed0e2f54bd106261e5f5422a6f5526bfcbfbb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2! = 2$\" width=\"47\" height=\"13\" /></li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/b/4db3b59940e4f5cd42bbab2b7815c452a0197507.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3! = 6$\" width=\"47\" height=\"13\" /></li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/2/482b0fba62fc7502e8b9fb930374b8f096a3a940.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4! = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" /></li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/a/48a578519da397fe10b98efaa61cb1c65ca1b243.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5! = 120$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"65\" height=\"13\" /></li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/e/e7eda87c94b57e1e5b8a10651948bccba5bf6e0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6! = 720$\" width=\"65\" height=\"13\" /></li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/5/8751427c5f82ab48a2dfd1eff91de9712b73435f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7! = 5040$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"74\" height=\"13\" /></li>\n<li><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/1/6419c4d5e24b5d2e57d63995511fcecd11abd564.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8! = 40320$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"